  "bio": "Curtis is a highly skilled tattoo artist based in Perth, Canada, who specializes in the unique styles of floral and trashpolka. His attention to cleanliness is unparalleled, ensuring that every client's experience is not only artistically exceptional but also held to the highest standards of hygiene. Clients consistently leave Curtis's studio not only with beautiful artwork but also with the peace of mind that their health and safety are prioritized.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location: Perth, Ontario, Canada"
